Note: This bit is applicable only in standard SPI slave mode
} Bits {0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7} Readable 1 ID Slave_Select_Mode Writeable 1 Name Slave_Select_Mode} {ParentID IPISR Description {DRR not empty.
